.TH HASHMAP_GET 3
.SH NAME
hashmap_get \- retrieve a value by string key
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <hashmap.h>
.P
.BI "void* hashmap_get(hashmap* " map ", const char* " key ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR hashmap_get ()
looks up the value associated with the string
.I key
in the hashmap
.IR map .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a pointer to the value, or NULL if the key is not found.